#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0196 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "THE PARAM ALL-FACET GATE (Fix #331 bucket 2, M2-D24 / M3-D18; pin owed by review S9 and authored by Fix #340). The ADLBC dataset deliberately declares no PARAM column, so Requirements.Variables.All [PARAM] rejects the dataset and the rule is SKIPPED naming PARAM. Remove the All entry and the rule EXECUTES: since Fix #330 retired the injected var_exists guard, a bare empty(PARAM) is TRUE on every row of an absent column (absent = all-missing) and nothing else in the Check restricts the rows, so it would fire on EVERY row -- the flood the gate exists for. If this scenario EXECUTES (violation or silent pass), the gate has been removed -- escalate, do not rewrite the pin."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 2.5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALT | 7.0
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1034 |  | 9.9
